<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores in the</p>
<p>four-day Supersport Series cricket match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Durban (day one): Boland 133 (Shaun Pollock 4-22, Gary</p>
<p>Gilder 4-36). Natal 85 for four.</p>
